<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">com-mūnĭo</span></b> ,
			īvi or ii, ītum, 4, v.
		a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to fortify
				on all sides</i> or <i>strongly</i>, <i>to secure</i>, 
			<i>barricade</i>, <i>intrench</i>
			(class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">castella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes. B.
					G. 1, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Nep. Alcib. 7, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">castra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 5, 49</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Liv. 2, 32, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21, 32, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">42, 58, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loca castellis idonea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nep.
					Milt. 2, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hibernacula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					22, 32, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praesidium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					2, 49, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tumulum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 1, 43</span></i>
			.—<b>Transf.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os arteriae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 17, 11, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to make sure</i>,
				<i>to strengthen</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auctoritatem aulae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 15, 4, 6</span></i>
			 (cf. aula, II. A.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">causam testimoniis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rosc. Com. 15, 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Caecin. 26, 74</span></i>
			.</div>
